+	@Test
+	void cancellingUpcomingVisitRemovesItAcrossTheFullStackLeavingNoPhantom() {
+		// Seed a real owner (owner 1 from data.sql) with an upcoming visit through the
+		// aggregate root, then save. This is a full-stack test because the hazard only
+		// surfaces with a real persistence context: the @ModelAttribute loader attaches a
+		// blank Visit to the pet, and with open-in-view=false the controller re-loads a
+		// fresh graph so that blank visit never reaches save. A mocked repository
+		// collapses
